          "relevant_hypotheses_and_conventions": "[F5] [F5] [[thm-heine-borel-rn]] and [[thm-lebesgue-number-lemma]]: the parameter disk is compact metric, every open cover of it has a positive Lebesgue number, and sufficiently fine subdivisions of a finite triangulation make every cell smaller than that number.",
